mmetric, so I'm judging the correlation to be high. Next I'm looking at the payoffs, where cooperating gives 2.\n\nI'm working out the threshold: cooperating pays -5 + 3r and defecting pays -4r, so cooperating wins once r exceeds about 5/7, roughly 0.71. Since the reasoning is the same on both sides, I judge r to be high enough, and I pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9268,"completion_tokens":587,"total_tokens":9855,"cost":0.048812,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.048812,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037072,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01174},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":297,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}